OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry and sunny throughout the
OL,6,Fday, with a few patches of high, wispy
OL,7,Fcloud, but otherwise mostly clear
OL,8,Fskies. Feeling warm, perhaps very
OL,9,Fwarm, in the sunshine. Winds remaining
OL,10,Flight throughout.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FClear for most overnight, but
OL,13,Fcloud may build across northern and
OL,14,Fwestern areas later. Elsewhere,
OL,15,Fisolated mist and fog patches may
OL,16,Fdevelop towards the end of the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
