OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FAnother dry day with plenty
OL,6,Fof sunshine Tuesday, perhaps cloudier
OL,7,Facross the far north and west of the
OL,8,Fregion. Feeling warm, perhaps very
OL,9,Fwarm, in the sunshine, with light
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,13,Fbright start on Wednesday, but cloud
OL,14,Fand rain arriving later, then clearing
OL,15,Fovernight to give a fine and sunny
OL,16,FThursday after a chilly start. Further
OL,17,Frain possible on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
